<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no"/>
<title>Hai Phong — IntelliWhere Flood Risk</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css"/>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;font-family:-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;background:#0d1117}
#map{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0}

/* TOP PILL */
#topbar{
  position:fixed;top:10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:800;
  background:rgba(13,17,35,0.93);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.6);
  border-radius:30px;padding:5px 14px 5px 8px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);max-width:calc(100vw - 110px);
  box-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden
}
#topbar img{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;background:#0d1b40}
.tb-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1.2}
.tb-sub{font-size:10px;color:#4a7a9a;line-height:1.2}

/* SPATIAL LAYERS BUTTON */
#layer-btn{
  position:fixed;top:10px;right:10px;z-index:801;
  background:rgba(13,17,35,0.93);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.6);
  color:#8eacc8;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;
  font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);white-space:nowrap;
  box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)
}
#ldot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#1b7fa0;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .3s}

/* LEGEND — dynamic */
#legend{
  position:fixed;bottom:120px;left:10px;z-index:700;
  background:rgba(13,17,35,0.93);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.5);
  border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;min-width:160px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);transition:opacity .25s,transform .25s;
  box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)
}
#legend.hidden{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:translateY(4px)}
.leg-hdr{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:7px;gap:10px}
.leg-hdr-txt{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.leg-x{color:#4a7a9a;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;padding:0 2px}
.leg-section{margin-bottom:6px}
.leg-section-title{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#4a7a9a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;margin-bottom:4px}
.leg-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:3px 0;color:#c8d6e8;font-size:11px}
.leg-dot{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.leg-sq{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0}
.leg-line{width:18px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0}
.leg-dash{width:18px;height:2px;flex-shrink:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#1e50b4 0,#1e50b4 4px,transparent 4px,transparent 7px)}
#leg-show{
  position:fixed;bottom:120px;left:10px;z-index:700;display:none;
  background:rgba(13,17,35,0.93);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.5);
  color:#8eacc8;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:16px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer
}

/* BOTTOM DRAWER */
#drawer{
  position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:750;
  background:rgba(10,14,28,0.97);border-top:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.3);
  padding:8px 0 max(10px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) 0
}
.drw-handle{width:32px;height:3px;background:#2a3d55;border-radius:2px;margin:0 auto 8px}
#btn-row{display:flex;gap:7px;overflow-x:auto;padding:0 10px;scrollbar-width:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
#btn-row::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.dbtn{
  flex-shrink:0;background:rgba(27,127,160,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.45);
  color:#8eacc8;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;
  font-size:12px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;min-height:42px;
  transition:background .15s,color .15s
}
.dbtn:active{background:#1b7fa0;color:#fff}

/* SLIDE-UP SHEET */
.sheet{
  position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:900;
  background:#0b1122;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.5);
  border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;
  transform:translateY(100%);
  transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1),opacity .32s;
  max-height:85vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  box-shadow:0 -4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;
  /* always in DOM, always flex — no display toggling */
}
.sheet.open{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.sh-handle{width:32px;height:3px;background:#2a3d55;border-radius:2px;margin:10px auto 0;flex-shrink:0}
.sh-hdr{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.2);flex-shrink:0}
.sh-title{color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.sh-close{color:#4a7a9a;font-size:26px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;padding:0 4px;min-width:40px;text-align:right}
.sh-body{overflow-y:auto;flex:1;padding:14px 16px;padding-bottom:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom));-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}

/* DISTRICT DETAIL */
.det-hero{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:rgba(27,127,160,0.1);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.det-score-num{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;line-height:1}
.det-score-of{font-size:12px;color:#4a7a9a;margin-top:1px}
.det-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:5px}
.det-dname{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.det-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,26,46,1);font-size:13px}
.det-row:last-of-type{border-bottom:none}
.det-lbl{color:#4a7a9a;flex-shrink:0;margin-right:8px}
.det-val{color:#c8d6e8;font-weight:600;text-align:right}
.inc-box{background:rgba(27,127,160,0.1);border-left:3px solid #1b7fa0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;margin-top:12px}
.inc-lbl{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#1b7fa0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:5px}
.inc-txt{color:#a8c8e0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
.ph-txt{color:#334455;font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}

/* SLIDESHOW */
.slide{display:none}.slide.active{display:block}
.sd-name{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:5px}
.sd-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:10px}
.sd-bar{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-bottom:10px}
.pip{flex:1;height:7px;border-radius:3px;background:#1e2d40}
.pip.v{background:#d32f2f}.pip.h{background:#f57c00}.pip.m{background:#f9a825}
.sd-body{color:#c8d6e8;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:10px}
.sd-ev{background:rgba(27,127,160,0.1);border-left:3px solid #1b7fa0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}
.sd-ev-title{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#1b7fa0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:6px}
.sd-ev p{color:#a8c8e0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:5px}
.sd-ev p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.ss-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 0 2px;margin-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.2)}
.ss-btn{background:rgba(26,39,68,1);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.5);color:#8eacc8;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;min-width:80px;text-align:center}
.ss-btn:active{background:#1b7fa0;color:#fff}
.ss-count{color:#4a7a9a;font-size:12px}
.fly-btn{width:100%;background:#1b7fa0;border:none;color:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-top:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px}
.fly-btn:active{background:#148090}

/* CONTENT */
.ov-sec{margin-bottom:18px}
.ov-h{color:#1b7fa0;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.2);padding-bottom:5px;margin-bottom:9px}
.ov-p{color:#c8d6e8;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:7px}
.ov-card{background:rgba(27,127,160,0.1);border-left:3px solid #1b7fa0;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:0 7px 7px 0;margin:7px 0}
.ov-card strong{color:#fff;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;font-size:13px}
.ov-card span,.ov-card p{color:#a8c8e0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}
.ov-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;margin:2px 3px 6px 0}
.tag-r{background:rgba(211,47,47,.2);color:#ff5252;border:1px solid rgba(211,47,47,.4)}
.tag-o{background:rgba(245,124,0,.2);color:#ffb74d;border:1px solid rgba(245,124,0,.4)}
.tag-g{background:rgba(56,142,60,.2);color:#69f0ae;border:1px solid rgba(56,142,60,.4)}
.cl-card{background:rgba(26,39,68,.5);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.2);border-radius:9px;padding:11px 13px;margin:7px 0}
.cl-ct{color:#1b7fa0;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:5px}
.cl-card p{color:#c8d6e8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
.stat-c{background:rgba(27,127,160,0.1);border-left:3px solid #1b7fa0;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:0 7px 7px 0;margin:7px 0;color:#e0ecf8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}
.stat-c strong{color:#fff}
.yb{display:inline-block;background:rgba(27,127,160,.3);color:#80d8ff;font-size:10px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:700}
.disc{color:#334455;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.15);padding-top:9px;margin-top:10px}

/* LAYER PANEL */
#layer-panel{
  position:fixed;top:58px;right:10px;z-index:850;width:262px;
  background:rgba(11,17,34,0.97);border:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.5);
  border-radius:14px;display:none;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.6)
}
#layer-panel.open{display:flex}
#lp-hdr{background:#111d30;padding:10px 13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,127,160,0.2)}
#lp-hdr span{color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.lp-x{color:#4a7a9a;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer;padding:0 2px}
#lp-body{padding:4px 11px 8px;overflow-y:auto;max-height:70vh}
.lr{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,26,46,1)}
.lr:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.ls{width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:3px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.ll{color:#c8d6e8;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
.ld{color:#2a3d55;font-size:9px;margin-top:1px}
.tog{position:relative;width:34px;height:19px;flex-shrink:0}
.tog input{opacity:0;width:0;height:0}
.tog-sl{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#1a2535;border-radius:19px;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s;border:1px solid #2a3d55}
.tog-sl:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:13px;height:13px;left:2px;top:2px;background:#334455;border-radius:50%;transition:.18s}
.tog input:checked+.tog-sl{background:#1b7fa0;border-color:#1b7fa0}
.tog input:checked+.tog-sl:before{transform:translateX(15px);background:#fff}
.lp-note{font-size:9px;color:#1e2d40;padding:7px 0 1px;text-align:center;line-height:1.4;border-top:1px solid rgba(15,26,46,1)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="map"></div>

<!-- TOP PILL -->
<div id="topbar">
  <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="IntelliWhere"/>
  <div>
    <div class="tb-name">Hai Phong — Flood Risk</div>
    <div class="tb-sub">IntelliWhere &middot; intelliwhere@gmail.com</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SPATIAL LAYERS BUTTON -->
<button id="layer-btn" onclick="toggleLP()">
  <div id="ldot"></div> Spatial Layers
</button>

<!-- LEGEND -->
<div id="legend">
  <div class="leg-hdr">
    <span class="leg-hdr-txt" id="leg-title">Risk Level</span>
    <span class="leg-x" onclick="hideLeg()">&times;</span>
  </div>
  <div id="leg-content">
    <div class="leg-row"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#d32f2f"></div>Very High (5)</div>
    <div class="leg-row"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#f57c00"></div>High (4)</div>
    <div class="leg-row"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#f9a825"></div>Medium (3)</div>
    <div class="leg-row"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#388e3c"></div>Low (1&ndash;2)</div>
  </div>
</div>
<button id="leg-show" onclick="showLeg()">&#128308; Legend</button>

<!-- BOTTOM DRAWER -->
<div id="drawer">
  <div class="drw-handle"></div>
  <div id="btn-row">
    <button class="dbtn" onclick="openSheet('sh-det')">&#128205; District Detail</button>
    <button class="dbtn" onclick="openSheet('sh-scores')">&#128202; Score Evidence</button>
    <button class="dbtn" onclick="openSheet('sh-interp')">&#128269; Interpretation</button>
    <button class="dbtn" onclick="openSheet('sh-impl')">&#128204; Implications</button>
    <button class="dbtn" onclick="openSheet('sh-rec')">&#128101; Recommendations</button>
    <button class="dbtn" onclick="openSheet('sh-city')">&#127961;&#65039; City Context</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SHEET: DISTRICT DETAIL -->
<div class="sheet" id="sh-det">
  <div class="sh-handle"></div>
  <div class="sh-hdr"><div class="sh-title">&#128205; District Detail</div><div class="sh-close" onclick="closeSheet('sh-det')">&times;</div></div>
  <div class="sh-body">
    <div id="det-ph" class="ph-txt">Tap any district on the map to see its risk breakdown.</div>
    <div id="det-body" style="display:none">
      <div class="det-hero">
        <div><div class="det-score-num" id="d-num">-</div><div class="det-score-of">/ 5 score</div></div>
        <div><div class="det-badge" id="d-badge">-</div><div class="det-dname" id="d-name">-</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="det-row"><span class="det-lbl">Elevation</span><span class="det-val" id="d-elev">-</span></div>
      <div class="det-row"><span class="det-lbl">Hazard</span><span class="det-val" id="d-haz">-</span></div>
      <div class="inc-box"><div class="inc-lbl">Verified incident</div><div class="inc-txt" id="d-inc">-</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SHEET: SCORE EVIDENCE -->
<div class="sheet" id="sh-scores">
  <div class="sh-handle"></div>
  <div class="sh-hdr"><div class="sh-title">&#128202; Score Evidence</div><div class="sh-close" onclick="closeSheet('sh-scores')">&times;</div></div>
  <div class="sh-body">
    <div id="ss-wrap">
      <div class="slide active" data-district="Do Son">
        <div class="sd-name">Do Son</div>
        <div class="sd-badge" style="background:rgba(211,47,47,.25);color:#ff5252;border:1px solid rgba(211,47,47,.5)">Very High &mdash; 5/5</div>
        <div class="sd-bar"><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div></div>
        <div class="sd-body">Coastal peninsula at ~2m elevation, directly exposed to the Gulf of Tonkin. No natural barrier. Hai Phong's most typhoon-vulnerable urban zone.</div>
        <div class="sd-ev"><div class="sd-ev-title">Verified Incidents</div>
          <p>Typhoon Mirinae (2009): 3m storm surge submerged the peninsula. 45,000 residents evacuated. &mdash; ReliefWeb UN OCHA.</p>
          <p>Coastline lost 50&ndash;80m of beach over 20 years, reducing natural surge buffer.</p>
          <p>MARD 2021 audit: Do Son dike systems rated sub-standard for Category 3+ typhoon loading.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="fly-btn" onclick="flyTo('Do Son')">&#128205; Zoom to District</button>
      </div>
      <div class="slide" data-district="Hai An">
        <div class="sd-name">Hai An (Port Zone)</div>
        <div class="sd-badge" style="background:rgba(211,47,47,.25);color:#ff5252;border:1px solid rgba(211,47,47,.5)">Very High &mdash; 5/5</div>
        <div class="sd-bar"><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div></div>
        <div class="sd-body">Hosts Hai Phong's primary container port at 2m elevation. Sits in the storm surge pathway from the Van Uc river mouth.</div>
        <div class="sd-ev"><div class="sd-ev-title">Verified Incidents</div>
          <p>Typhoon Son Tinh (July 2018): port gates overtopped, 12,000 homes flooded, operations suspended 48 hours. &mdash; VnExpress, July 2018.</p>
          <p>River surge + direct coastal surge arrive simultaneously, doubling peak water levels.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="fly-btn" onclick="flyTo('Hai An')">&#128205; Zoom to District</button>
      </div>
      <div class="slide" data-district="Tien Lang">
        <div class="sd-name">Tien Lang</div>
        <div class="sd-badge" style="background:rgba(211,47,47,.25);color:#ff5252;border:1px solid rgba(211,47,47,.5)">Very High &mdash; 5/5</div>
        <div class="sd-bar"><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div></div>
        <div class="sd-body">Hai Phong's lowest-lying district at under 1.5m average elevation. First to flood when any of three river branches overflow.</div>
        <div class="sd-ev"><div class="sd-ev-title">Verified Incidents</div>
          <p>2008 Red River flood: inundated 3&ndash;7 continuous days, 60% of farmland lost.</p>
          <p>2017 flood: secondary dikes overtopped, district isolated. &mdash; UNDP Vietnam 2019.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="fly-btn" onclick="flyTo('Tien Lang')">&#128205; Zoom to District</button>
      </div>
      <div class="slide" data-district="Duong Kinh">
        <div class="sd-name">Duong Kinh</div>
        <div class="sd-badge" style="background:rgba(211,47,47,.25);color:#ff5252;border:1px solid rgba(211,47,47,.5)">Very High &mdash; 5/5</div>
        <div class="sd-bar"><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div><div class="pip v"></div></div>
        <div class="sd-body">Natural funnel between Do Son peninsula and Lach Tray river outlet for converging storm surge.</div>
        <div class="sd-ev"><div class="sd-ev-title">Verified Incidents</div>
          <p>Typhoon Haiyan (2013): surge propagated inland. MARD 2021: dikes inadequate for 100-year storms.</p>
          <p>Tidal flooding occurs 15&ndash;20 days per year during spring tides &mdash; worsening annually.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="fly-btn" onclick="flyTo('Duong Kinh')">&#128205; Zoom to District</button>
      </div>
      <div class="slide" data-district="Hong Bang">
        <div class="sd-name">Hong Bang</div>
        <div class="sd-badge" style="background:rgba(245,124,0,.25);color:#ffb74d;border:1px solid rgba(245,124,0,.5)">High &mdash; 4/5</div>
        <div class="sd-bar"><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip"></div></div>
        <div class="sd-body">Historic urban core with dense development and ageing drainage infrastructure.</div>
        <div class="sd-ev"><div class="sd-ev-title">Verified Incidents</div>
          <p>August 2022: 200mm in 6 hours &mdash; 40% of streets flooded, 1,500 homes affected. &mdash; Tuoi Tre, 2022.</p>
          <p>Designated priority drainage upgrade zone in Hai Phong City Flood Management Plan 2023.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="fly-btn" onclick="flyTo('Hong Bang')">&#128205; Zoom to District</button>
      </div>
      <div class="slide" data-district="Cat Hai">
        <div class="sd-name">Cat Hai Island</div>
        <div class="sd-badge" style="background:rgba(245,124,0,.25);color:#ffb74d;border:1px solid rgba(245,124,0,.5)">High &mdash; 4/5</div>
        <div class="sd-bar"><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip h"></div><div class="pip"></div></div>
        <div class="sd-body">Accessible only by ferry. Post-storm isolation creates unique risk not captured by standard insurance.</div>
        <div class="sd-ev"><div class="sd-ev-title">Verified Incidents</div>
          <p>Typhoon Bebinca (2024): 3,200 evacuated, ferry suspended 72 hours. &mdash; VnExpress, 2024.</p>
          <p>Assets unreachable by adjusters or emergency crews for 2&ndash;5 days post-typhoon.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="fly-btn" onclick="flyTo('Cat Hai')">&#128205; Zoom to District</button>
      </div>
      <div class="slide" data-district="Vinh Bao">
        <div class="sd-name">Vinh Bao</div>
